OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of smaller Christmas trees
OL,4,Aafter hot summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FChoosing a real Christmas tree has
OL,7,Fbecome an annual tradition for people
OL,8,Facross the country.
OL,10,FBut growers in Nottinghamshire have
OL,11,Fwarned that after the UK's hottest
OL,12,Fsummer on record, buyers should brace
OL,13,Fthemselves for trees that may be
OL,14,Fsmaller than they are used to.
OL,16,FRachel Kirk, from Costock Christmas
OL,17,FTrees, said up to a quarter of the
OL,18,Ftrees they planted in the spring had
OL,19,Fdied, raising fears of a lasting impact
OL,20,Fin years to come.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
