OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of smaller Christmas trees
OL,4,Aafter hot summer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not ideal at all, but for the
OL,7,Fweather there's nothing we can do about
OL,8,Fit. We've just got to work with it and
OL,9,Fadapt how we can," she said.
